# Host functions every guest imports, on Android and on Linux (declared in
# port/android/guest/runtime/guest_host.h, defined in port/android/host).
# The Android app's own are in android_imports.list, the Linux desktop's in
# port/linux/host/host_imports.list. tools/android_imports.py generates the
# stubs; tools/check_host_imports.py checks the lists against the
# declarations.
